r=\"#2a2a2a\"><font size=\"3\">&#8203;A little goes a very long way. We thank you for your kindness.<br><br>**We encourage to visit the Amazon and bring your own donations so that you can share in person** Love and light to you all.</font></font></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n      </div>\n\n\t"
